---
title:    "Compiling Multi-Paradigm Declarative Programs into Prolog"
citation: "(FroCoS 2000)"
url:      "https://www.michaelhanus.de/papers/FROCOS00.html"
date:     2000-01-01 # used for sorting, most recent first, should usually match the papers date
---
This paper describes a method to compile Curry programs into Prolog programs.
This compiler is the central part of the [PAKCS programming environment](https://www.curry-lang.org/pakcs/) for Curry.